  "title": "Rwanda: TotalEnergies and DelAgua join forces to provide access to clean cooking for 200,000 households",
  "summary": "Paris, November 13, 2025 – TotalEnergies has entered into a partnership with DelAgua to distribute improved cooking stoves to hundreds of thousands of Rwandans. This initiative supports Rwanda’s ambition to provide universal access to clean cooking by 2030 and is in line with TotalEnergies’ ambition to provide more affordable, more available, more sustainable energy accessible […]",
